  "title": "Is a GLP-1 Right for Your Teen? How Families Can Decide on Weight-Management Medication",
  "summary": "A GLP-1 can be an option for some teens 12 and older who have obesity, but it is never a simple yes-or-no. This decision guide walks families through who these medicines are actually for, how shared decision-making with your pediatrician works, the questions to ask before starting, and how to weigh the real benefits against the side effects and long-term unknowns — including when deciding to wait is the right call.",
